 "method": "The county clerk pointed this app on 2026-10-29 to the District Boundaries page of the county's website, whose 'Commissioner Districts (May 2022)' PDF is a map of the Census Bureau's 2020 blocks by commissioner district. The page credits the map to Surveying And Mapping, LLC, which reserves its rights, so it is not kept here; its SHA-256 is mapSha256. The map's two district outlines are vector lines. They were read out of the PDF and lined up with the outline of the county's 2020 census blocks in Missouri East state plane coordinates (an affine fit, median 26 m along the county edge), and each of the county's 1,792 blocks was put in the district holding most of it. The map prints the districts' 2020 populations, 9,429 in District 1 and 7,005 in District 2, and the blocks put in each here add up to the same. Two blocks with no people lie across the line and went to the district holding most of each.",
